flowchart LR
  User[Enterprise User] --> Auth[Identity Provider]
  Auth --> API[Agent API Boundary]
  API --> Guardrails[Bedrock Guardrails]
  Guardrails --> Orchestrator[Agent Orchestrator]
  Orchestrator --> Bedrock[Amazon Bedrock]
  Orchestrator --> MCP[MCP Tool Gateway]
  MCP --> Tools[Enterprise APIs / AWS Tools]
  Orchestrator --> KB[Knowledge Base / Vector Store]
  Orchestrator --> Obs[CloudWatch + X-Ray + OTel]
  Orchestrator --> Events[EventBridge Audit Events]
  Events --> Human[Human-in-the-loop Review]
